<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="DeepFake-AI Antigravity" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="diag_FreqForensicsArchitecture" name="FreqForensicsArchitecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1320" pageHeight="840" background="#0a0f1d" math="1" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="node_2" value="&lt;b&gt;Spatial RGB Image&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Pixel Intensity Domain&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Normalized RGB Tensor: [B, 3, 256, 256]&lt;br&gt;• Preserves Spatial Context &amp;amp; Edges&lt;br&gt;• Boundary Seam Contrast&lt;br&gt;• Color Histogram Artifacts&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#38bdf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[[B, 3, 256, 256]]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#38bdf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="150" width="260" height="240" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_3" value="&lt;b&gt;2D-DCT Frequency Map&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Spectral Energy Domain&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• 2D Discrete Cosine Transform (2D-DCT):&lt;br&gt;    F(u,v) = α(u)α(v) Σ Σ I(x,y) cos(...) cos(...)&lt;br&gt;• Log-Power Spectrum: log(1 + |F(u,v)|)&lt;br&gt;• Azimuthal Energy Integration&lt;br&gt;• Exposes GAN Checkerboard Grids&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#818cf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[[B, 3, 256, 256]]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="460" width="260" height="270" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_4" value="&lt;b&gt;Spatial Convolutional Stream&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Conv2D Feature Extraction&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Layer 1: Conv2d(3→32, k=3, p=1) + BatchNorm2d + ReLU&lt;br&gt;• Pooling: MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2, stride=2)&lt;br&gt;• Layer 2: Conv2d(32→64, k=3, p=1)&lt;br&gt;• Global Pool: AdaptiveAvgPool2d((4, 4))&lt;br&gt;• Flattening: 64 * 4 * 4 = 1024 features&lt;br&gt;• Output: f_spatial ∈ R^1024&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#06b6d4;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[f_spatial ∈ R^1024]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#06b6d4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="340" y="150" width="360" height="260" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_5" value="&lt;b&gt;Spectral Convolutional Stream&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;High-Frequency Discrepancy&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Layer 1: Conv2d(3→32, k=3, p=1) + BatchNorm2d + ReLU&lt;br&gt;• Pooling: MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2, stride=2)&lt;br&gt;• Layer 2: Conv2d(32→64, k=3, p=1)&lt;br&gt;• Global Pool: AdaptiveAvgPool2d((4, 4))&lt;br&gt;• Flattening: 64 * 4 * 4 = 1024 features&lt;br&gt;• Output: f_spectral ∈ R^1024&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#818cf8;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[f_spectral ∈ R^1024]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="340" y="460" width="360" height="260" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_6" value="&lt;b&gt;Channel Fusion &amp;amp; Concat&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Multi-Domain Feature Alignment&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Concatenation Layer:&lt;br&gt;    fused = [f_spatial || f_spectral] ∈ R^2048&lt;br&gt;• Expansion Linear: Linear(2048 → 128)&lt;br&gt;• Non-Linear Activation: ReLU&lt;br&gt;• Regularization: Dropout(p = 0.50)&lt;br&gt;• Output Feature Vector: f_dense ∈ R^128&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#c084fc;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[fused ∈ R^2048]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#c084fc;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="740" y="290" width="280" height="250" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_7" value="&lt;b&gt;Forensic Classifier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Binary Logits&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Linear(128 → 2)&lt;br&gt;• Softmax Probabilities:&lt;br&gt;    P(Real) vs P(Fake)&lt;br&gt;• Cross-Entropy Loss&lt;br&gt;• High Generalization Across Unseen Generators&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#34d399;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[Binary Softmax]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#062e1e;strokeColor=#34d399;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1060" y="170" width="220" height="220" /></mxCell><mxCell id="node_8" value="&lt;b&gt;Frequency Grad-CAM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i style='color:#94a3b8;'&gt;Explainable Saliency&lt;/i&gt;&lt;hr style='border-color:#1e293b;'&gt;• Backpropagated Gradients&lt;br&gt;• Channel-Weighted 2D Map&lt;br&gt;• Spatial Heatmap Overlay&lt;br&gt;• Highlights High-Frequency Checkerboard Artifacts&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold;'&gt;[XAI Heatmap]&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#141e33;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1060" y="460" width="220" height="230" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_9" value="1024-D Spatial" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#06b6d4;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#06b6d4;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_4" target="node_6"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_10" value="1024-D Spectral" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#818cf8;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#818cf8;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_5" target="node_6"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_11" value="Dense 128-D" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#34d399;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#34d399;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_6" target="node_7"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="edge_12" value="Saliency Gradients" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#f59e0b;fontSize=10;" edge="1" parent="1" source="node_6" target="node_8"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>